write-ahead log                 | https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/search_by_date?query=write-ahead%20log&tags=story      # 3  ("anti-entropy"=0)
database replication            | https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/search_by_date?query=database%20replication&tags=story # 8

