self-replication                | https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/search_by_date?query=self-replication&tags=story       # 5

# --- self-development: autopoiesis; evolutionary computation; A-life  (doc row 9) ---
artificial life                 | https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/search_by_date?query=artificial%20life&tags=story      # 7  ("autopoiesis"=0)
genetic algorithm               | https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/search_by_date?query=genetic%20algorithm&tags=story    # 5  ("evolutionary computation"=0)

# --- antifragility: chaos engineering — the doc's own "missing discipline" (§5) ---
chaos engineering               | https://hn.algolia.com/api/v1/search_by_date?query=chaos%20engineering&tags=story    # 2
